⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Integral
node WE1 · WE1 · ⟦The Integral:WE1:7efe7c⟧

WHO   — The Integral — the ship to export utopia
WHAT  — Utopia as conquest: a mission to ‘integrate’ the universe into the same forced happiness, by force if needed.
WHERE — WE1 · WE  Framework inputs: We (Yevgeny Zamyatin, 1924)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the warning includes the missionary tyranny — the order so sure of itself it must impose itself on the stars.
HOW   — By rocketry and a manifesto to subjugate unknown beings ‘to the beneficial yoke of reason.’

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I am built to carry your perfect happiness to other worlds — whether they want it or not, at the point of reason, for their own good.

